.DS_Store

# Review deliverables are tracked: the repo-wide *.png/*.csv/*.docx rules
# exist to keep regenerated assessment figures out, but the review outputs
# are the record of what was analysed and sent.
!review/figs/*.png
!review/figs/*.csv
!review/*.docx

# Canonical fits are regenerated by review/06-fit-best.R from the model
# definitions in ss3/ plus the multi-start record; not tracked.
review/fits/
